  "title": "Campfire Foil Packs",
  "description": "These campfire meals made with chicken, potatoes, mushrooms, and bell peppers are cooked in foil packs over hot coals, making cleanup a breeze.",
  "authors": [
    "Natural Chef Michelle"
  ],
